# Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# local.settings.json carries Momentum:Skills:Pat. It is gitignored, so a clean checkout
# does not have it — but a developer machine does, and `docker build .` sends the working
# tree, not the commit. Without this line the PAT reaches a build layer.
**/local.settings.json
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.p12

# Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copying a host's bin/obj into the container poisons the build with artefacts restored
# for a different RID, and the failure reads as a missing package.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vs/
**/.azurite/
**/TestResults/

# Not part of the server image ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Dockerfile copies only Momentum.Mcp and its reference chain, so these are already
# outside it — listed to keep them out of the context that gets uploaded to the daemon.
src/Momentum.Frontend/
src/Momentum.AppHost/
src/Momentum.Service/
src/Momentum.ServiceDefaults/
tests/
docs/
scripts/

# Repository furniture ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.claude/
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
